        "content": "d through the use of the <code>/etc/passwd</code> file. On macOS, the <code>dscl . list /Users</code> command can be used to enumerate local accounts. On ESXi servers, the `esxcli system account list` command can list local user accounts.(Citation: Crowdstrike Hypervisor Jackpotting Pt 2 2021)\",\n  \"x_mitre_platforms\": [\n    \"ESXi\",\n    \"Linux\",\n    \"macOS\",\n    \"Windows\"\n  ]\n}",
